Bounceformer was made for the Hack Club Haven Gamejam

The premise is simple, you're a knight traveling through a dungeon full of skeletons and zombies.
But..... You have a gun! And you know what's better than a boring old normal gun? A gun that has bouncing bullets!
Though watch out! Because the bullets bounce forever until they hit something other than a wall, and you are very much vulnurable to them.

Controls:
W - jump
A/D - move left/right
space - shoot
left/right arrow keys - look left/right
up arrow - looks up in the direction you were previously looking

